neofontrender_ui_enhancements.tooltip.flight_roll.enabled=Enable continuous three-axis elytra control: horizontal mouse input rolls while vertical input pitches around the current aircraft frame, allowing any number of complete rolls. Disables itself when RollTheSky is installed.
neofontrender_ui_enhancements.tooltip.flight_roll.allow_in_water=Keep flight-roll control and the rolled camera pose after entering water. Disable this to return immediately to the normal upright water view.
neofontrender_ui_enhancements.tooltip.flight_roll.keyboard_yaw=Use the remappable yaw-left and yaw-right bindings, which default to A and D, while elytra flight roll is active.
neofontrender_ui_enhancements.tooltip.flight_roll.banking=Automatically add yaw and a small pitch correction from the current roll attitude, matching the coordinated-turn behavior of newer flight-roll mods.
neofontrender_ui_enhancements.tooltip.flight_roll.momentum=Mouse displacement controls a persistent virtual flight stick; move in the opposite direction to recenter it. Disable this for direct relative-mouse rotation.
neofontrender_ui_enhancements.tooltip.flight_roll.invert=Invert the selected flight axis after UIE combines mouse and controller input.
neofontrender_ui_enhancements.tooltip.flight_roll.controller=Controller mods can provide normalized axes through FlightControllerInputEvent; UIE does not require a particular gamepad library.
neofontrender_ui_enhancements.tooltip.flight_roll.barrels=Bind separate left and right barrel-roll keys under Controls. They are unbound by default to avoid modpack key conflicts.
neofontrender_ui_enhancements.tooltip.flight_roll.remote=When Revo UI Server Companion is installed, synchronize and render nearby players' flight-roll pose.
neofontrender_ui_enhancements.tooltip.flight_roll.hud=Draw Arc3D-powered flight instruments through UIE's shared HUD compositor.
neofontrender_ui_enhancements.tooltip.flight_roll.hud_theme=Built-in Airbus, Boeing, Microsoft Flight Simulator, FPV, and cinematic tactical layouts; player themes live in neofontrender/flight_hud_themes.
neofontrender_ui_enhancements.tooltip.flight_roll.hud_scale=Scales the responsive virtual canvas inside the current window safe area; 100% is the largest aspect-preserving fit.
neofontrender_ui_enhancements.tooltip.flight_roll.hud_horizon=Display pitch ladder and bank scale from the current aircraft attitude.
neofontrender_ui_enhancements.tooltip.flight_roll.hud_input=Display the current momentum-mouse or controller virtual-stick position.
neofontrender_ui_enhancements.tooltip.flight_roll.hud_visibility=Hide this vanilla HUD category through its individual Forge overlay event only while the flight HUD is actually visible. This does not cancel the complete HUD, UIE's compositor, or independent mod overlays.
neofontrender_ui_enhancements.tooltip.flight_roll.hud_hide_first_person_hand=Suppress only Minecraft's first-person hand render while the flight HUD is visible; world and HUD rendering remain active.
