neofontrender_ui_enhancements.tooltip.crosshair.hide_flight=Allows themes with a replacement reticle to skip only Minecraft/Forge's vanilla crosshair method without cancelling CROSSHAIRS. Themes such as MSFS may explicitly keep it.
