neofontrender_ui_enhancements.tooltip.crosshair.shoulder_surfing=Ordinary third person obeys this switch; an active Shoulder Surfing camera is treated as an aiming perspective and retains its own visibility and dynamic-position rules.
neofontrender_ui_enhancements.tooltip.crosshair.spyglass=Applies to UIE's C-key zoom and backported spyglasses listed by exact item ID in UIE's compatibility configuration.
neofontrender_ui_enhancements.tooltip.crosshair.outline=Draws a separate outline behind geometric styles.
neofontrender_ui_enhancements.tooltip.crosshair.dot=Adds an independently colored point at the center.
neofontrender_ui_enhancements.tooltip.crosshair.dynamic_attack=The arms spread while Minecraft's melee attack cooldown recovers.
neofontrender_ui_enhancements.tooltip.crosshair.dynamic_bow=The arms contract toward the configured gap as a bow is drawn.
